 - **A complex-typed declaration is rejected, in a different error shape per entry:** `prepareEvalPlan` as `sourceInvariant (.unsupportedElementType name spelling)` (Step 0 `buildDeclEnv`); direct `capabilityPreflight` as `.unsupportedDtype "<name>: <spelling> element type"`; `evalScatter` as `EvalError.compile (.unsupportedElementType …)`. Table: `test/DSL/ComplexElementTypeTest.lean`.
 
